Sky Home Launcher is a fork of Free My TV (https://github.com/simbasjungles/free-my-tv), used here under
the original project's MIT license (see LICENSE). This fork is not endorsed by or affiliated with the
original project or its authors.

What's changed since the fork:
- Renamed throughout (app, package id, repository) to Sky Home Launcher.
- Android/Google TV only: LG (webOS) and Samsung (Tizen) support, and the companion website, were removed.
- Added since the fork: the catalog screen and poster rows, the picks carousel, top input buttons, a Trakt
  integration (Continue Watching, Watchlist, episode browsing), remote-button learning (any button, any
  brand), installing Stremio and its Torrentio addon from within the app, per-app control over which
  turned-off apps stay off, and setting the TMDB/Watchmode/Trakt keys from a phone without rebuilding.

See the git history for the full, unabridged record of changes.
